{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の友達たちは\n受験を控えてる中\n乃木どこの選抜発表を見たとか\nもう本当にありがたい(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センターももうすぐだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験生のみなさん\n応援してるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、\nブログ読んでる場合じゃないか(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちだけ送っておこう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん届く"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/12/2078847/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中\nまたもや服を買っていた中田。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今日はちょっとだけだよ！\n耐えた！（￣＾￣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてドラマが始まりだして\n嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/01/12/2078847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビっ子ヽ(´ー｀)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際の髪の長さはどこ？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nまだそんな伸びてないかなー(´・ω・`）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこに服買いに行った？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n昨日も今日も渋谷行ったよ(・ω・)\n普段は新宿のが多いけどね(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのくらい服持ってる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nそんなん数えられないよ！w\nまあ、人並みには持ってると思うよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服は個別のための？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n個別のためにって買ったことは\nほとんど無いかなー(´・ω・`)\nサンタコスとかぐらい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","